L30_1 = [[
A girl who calls herself ordINAry, Ninomae Ina'nis was a priestess of the Ancient Ones long before she became a hololive VTuber.
It is said that Ina'nis gained the power to control tentacles after picking up a strange book. Could this have been her predestINAtion all along?

