L31_1 = [[
She is a veteran detective who solves any cases and a hololive Vtuber.
What? You are curious about how she does it? Well, Amelia says that she can share her secret with you.
Her secret is...! She is a time-traveling detective! Surprising, innit?

<color=#ffd34c>Hello~ Teamates! Hi~ Will you be my assistant today? Try to keep up with the veteran detective, huh?</color>]]
