L33_1 = [[
Did you know that hololive's Vtuber, Gawr Gura is a shark from Atlantis? Her razor-sharp teeth, intimidating tail, and terrifying roar make her the apex predator across all oceans. Shaaaark-!
No worries though! She is a shark generous to all Chumbuds.

<color=#ffd34c>Aww, look at this cute lil shark on the screen. Mmm? Wait that's me?!</color>]]
